			<name>Spontaneous Casting</name>
			<description>You can channel stored spell energy into summoning spells that you haven&#39;t prepares ahead of time. You can &quot;lose&quot; any prepared spell in order to cast any Summon Nature&#39;s Ally spell of the same spell level or lower</description>
			<type>DRUIDCLASSFEATURES.SPECIALATTACK</type>
